---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Knowledgebase"
description: "How-to guides for mesh networking, water purification, tool-sharing, and other infrastructure a community can run itself."
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<div class="section wrap">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h1>Knowledgebase</h1>
  </div>
  <p class="lede">
    How-to documents for the infrastructure ATP² cares about — written so someone with no prior background can actually follow along. Contributions and corrections welcome; see <a href="/get-involved/">Get Involved</a>.
  </p>

  <ul class="entry-list">
    {% for item in collections.knowledgebase %}
    <li class="entry">
      <h2 class="entry-title"><a href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.data.title }}</a></h2>
      <p class="entry-meta">
        <time datetime="{{ item.date | dateISO }}">{{ item.date | dateReadable }}</time>
        {% for tag in item.data.tags %}{% if tag != "knowledgebase" %}<span class="tag">{{ tag }}</span>{% endif %}{% endfor %}
      </p>
      {% if item.data.summary %}<p class="entry-summary">{{ item.data.summary }}</p>{% endif %}
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</div>
